2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT (Research):Jakub (James) Sobieski (1580-1646), Wojewoda of Ruthenia and Castellan of Cracow. In 1665 he married Zofia (Theophila) Danillowiezovna (1607-1661). Zofia's brother, Stanislaw Danillowicz, died in Tartar captivity. Zofia
2 CONC  was the daughter of Jan Danilowicz (1570-1628) and Zofia Zolkiewska (1590-1634). Zofia's grandparents were: Stanislaw Zolkiewski (1550-1620) and Regina Herburtowna (1566-1626).
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
