2 CONT * 2)        '''JADWIGA''' shortly before 16 Nov 1393-after 19 Feb 1439).  m (after 3 Jan 1410) JANOS Garay, son of MIKLÓS [I] Garay & his wife --- (-before 9 Apr 1428). 
