2 CONT
2 CONT * circa 1296 birth of Algirdas {Royal house: Gediminds};
2 CONT ** Algirdas' Title: Prince of Krewe
2 CONT ** 1317 marriage: ♀ Maria Yaroslavna of Vitebsk (c.1300-1346) - {Royal house: Ruriks of Polotsk}, daughter of Yaroslav Vasilevich, Prince of Vitebsk.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Agrippina Olgerdovna (c.1318-1393) - {Royal house: Gediminds}.
2 CONT ** from 1320 to 1345 Algirdas' Title: Prince of Vitebsk
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ # Dmitry Olgerdovich (c.1320-12 Aug 1399) - {Royal house: Gediminds} - alleged son.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Feodora / Theodora (c.1322-1376/1377) - {Royal house: Olgerdovich} wife of Sviatoslav Titovich, Prince of Karachev, s/o Tit Mstislavich, Prince of Karachev.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ NN (c.1324-c.1371) - {Royal house: Olgerdovich} wife of Ivan Yurevich?, Prince of Novosilsk and Odoyevsk, s/o Yuriy Romanovich, Prince of Novosil // or wife of Ivan Semionovich?, s/o Semion Mikhailovich, Prin
2 CONC ce of Glukhovo.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Feodor (1324/1326-before 1400) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Ratno, Lubomsk and Korbin.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Andrey Olgerdovich (c.1328-12 Aug 1399) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Pskov. Prince of Polotsk, killed in battle.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Konstantin Olgerdovich (c.1330-1386/1392) - {Royal house: Gediminds}, {Founder of Royal house: Czartoryski} Prince of Chartorysk.
2 CONT * child birth: ♂ Vladimir Olgerdovich / Olełko Włodzimierz - PL (c.1331-after 1398) - {Royal house: Olgerdovich}  Prince of Kiev.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Maria-Agrippina (c.1335-1393) - {Royal house: Olgerdovich} in 1354 married Boris Konstantinovich, Prince of Gorodeno, s/o Konstantin Vasilevich, Grand Prince of Suzdal and Nizhni-Novgorod & Elena (Yelena).
2 CONT ** from 1345 to 24 May 1377 Algirdas' Title: Grand Duke of Lithuania.
2 CONT ** 1350 marriage: ♀ Juliana / Yuliana Alexandrovna of Tver (c.1325-c.1392) - {Royal house: Ruriks of Tver} d/o Alexander I Mikhailovich, Prince of Tver, ex-Grand Prince of Vladimir & Anastasia Yurievna of Galich.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Kena/Kenna-Johanna of Lithuania (1350-27 Apr 1368) -  in 1360 married Casimir of Pommerania, s/o Boguslaw V Duke of Pomerania & Elźbieta of Poland.
2 CONT * birth of a child: Vilnius, Lithuania, ♂ # Jogaila/Jagiello-Vladislaus (c.1352- 1 June 1434) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Grand Prince of Lithuania 1382-1386 and 1392-1401. He succeeded as Wladyslaw II King of Poland 1386 to 1434.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Skirgaila-Ivan (1353- 11 Jan 1397) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Kiev from 1395,  Prince of Lithuania 1386-1392.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Elena-Evpraksia Olgerdovna? of Lithuania (c.1353-5 Sep 1438) - {Royal house: Gediminds}   married in winter 1371-1372 Vladimir Andreyevich “Khrobry" (the Brave), Prince of Sierpukhov and Bobrovsk, s/o Andrey 
2 CONC Ivanovich of Moscow, Prince of Sierpukhov and Bobrovsk & Maria Konstantinovna of Rostov-Borisoglebsk. Elena became a nun as Evpraksia.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Kaributas-Dimitry Olgerdovich (1355/1358-c.1404) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Novgorod Severskiy.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Švitrigaila Olgerdovich (1355-1452) - {Royal house: Gediminds}. 
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Lengvenis-Semyon / Szymon (baptized in 1386) Olgerdovich Gediminovich (c.1355-1431) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Mstislavsk. Married on14 Jun 1394 Maria Dmitrievna of Moscow, d/o Dmitry Ivanovich "Don
2 CONC skoy", Grand Prince of Vladimir, Prince of Moscovia & Yevdokia Dmitrievna of Suzdal (-1399). Second marriage in winter 1406-1707 with NN of Moscovia. 
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Karigaila / Korigajllo Olgerdovich (c.1360-28 Oct 1392) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Mstislavl, baptized in 1386 as Casimir or Vasili, killed in the battle of Vilnius.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Vygantas / Wigunt baptized as Aleksander (c.1360-28 Jun 1392) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Kirnovo, married in 1390 Hedwig von Oppeln, d/o Wladislaw, Duke of Oppeln, Palatine of Hungary {Royal house: 
2 CONC Piast} & Euphemia of Mazovia {Royal house: Piast}.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♂ Švitrigaila / Svidrigailo, baptized as Boleslaw (c.1360-10 Feb 1452) - {Royal house: Gediminds} Prince of Polock 1400-1402 and after 1406, Prince of Vladimir-Volhynsk, Perejeslavl and Volokolamsk, Prince of C
2 CONC hermigov 1419-1430.  He succeeded in 1430 as Švitrigaila Grand Duke of Lithuania, until 1432. Married in 1430/1433 Anna-Sofia Ivanovna of Tver, d/o Ivan Ivanovich, Prince of Tver.
2 CONT * birth of a child: ♀ Maria (1363-?) - {Royal house: Gediminds} in 1379 married Vaidila / Wojdylo, Starost of Lida (-1382), after 1382 married David Dmitrievich Prince of Gorodeno / Gorodetsk.
