1 NOTE duke Ernest, known as the Iron Duke, succeeded as ruler of Austria in 1406, successor to his brother Leopold IV.  The third son of Leopold III to rule, Ernest died in 1424, leaving as his successor Albert VI, his son, and brother 
2 CONC of of Frederick V.
