1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Stanisław Odrowąż''' herbu Odrowąż - '''wojewoda ruski''' od 1542, '''wojewoda podolski''' od 1535, '''kasztelan lwowski''' od 1533, '''starosta lwowski''' od 1534, '''starosta samborski'''. http://pl.wikipedia.
2 CONC org/wiki/Stanis%C5%82aw_II_Odrow%C4%85%C5%BC
2 CONT
2 CONT <<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<
2 CONT
2 CONT The 16th century Polish Nobility: http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id221.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Coat of arms	Odrowąż; Noble family	House of Odrowąż; Father	Jan Odrowąż; Mother	Anna Tarnowska-Jarosławska; Born	1509; Morraco Died	12 February/2 April 1545;
2 CONT
2 CONT Stanisław Odrowąż (1509-1545) was a Polish noble (szlachcic).
2 CONT
2 CONT He married to Katarzyna Górka in 1530 and Anna of Masovia from the Piast dynasty in February 1536. He had one child with Anna, Zofia Odrowąż.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was castellan of Lwów since 1533, starost of Lwów since 1534, voivode of Podole Voivodship since 1535, voivode of Ruthenian Voivodship since 1542 and starost of Sambor.
