1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from: http://www.schroeder.cal.pl/394.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord High Steward of Kalisz in the years 1446-1447,  Castellan of Ledzki in the years 1456-1458. In his youth he traveled around Europe, including served King of Cyprus, John, poslujac from him to Wladyslaw Jagiello to ask for hel
2 CONC p against the Turks. After returning to Poland, he won the King's forename in 1429, he received lifetime krolewszczyzny - Krosno and Żabno, in 1439, as part of a pledge, 100 fines Moszyny.
