1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Prince Konstanty Wiśniowiecki (1564–1641), Wojewoda Belski (Palatine of Belz) 1636, Wojewoda Ruski (Palatine of Ruthenia) 1638, and Starosta Czerkaski i Kamionecki was a wealthy, powerful and influential magnate, e
2 CONC xperienced in both politics and warfare.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married four times:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * circa 1583 Anna Zahorowska; had issue
2 CONT           o son Janusz Wiśniowiecki (1598–1636), daughters Helena Wiśniowiecka (married Stanisław Warszycki) and Marianna Wiśniowiecka (1600–1624; married Jakub Sobieski)
2 CONT     * 1603 Urszula Mniszech, sister of Maryna Mniszech; had issue
2 CONT           o sons Jerzy Wiśniowiecki (died 1641) and Aleksander Wiśniowiecki (died 1638/39), daughter Teofila Wiśniowiecka
2 CONT     * 1626/28 Katarzyna Korniaktowna (died circa 1635); no issue
2 CONT     * Krystyna Strusiowna (died after 1647); no issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Wiśniowiecki outlived all of his three sons; after his death, his estate was inherited by Prince Jeremi Wiśniowiecki.
