0 @N6000000002322320468@ NOTE Ancestors of lesser nobility, Jakob, at the end of his life, became castellan
1 CONT of krakow, an office that secured him the highest rank among the members of
1 CONT the Polish Senate, or first chamber of the parliament. Jakob saw to it that
1 CONT his son John was well educated, touring Europe in his youth, as was usual for
1 CONT a Polish noble of his class. John and his wife were often separated---John on
1 CONT the front, while his wife was on journeys to France---John wrote long letters
1 CONT to her which are highly interesting and an important historical source.
