0 @N6000000006128279866@ NOTE Föddes mellan 1394 och 1397, Varsovie ,   dog den 28 Sep. 1429, Türnitz   Far  Duke Ziemowit IV of Masovia,   f. fö 1357,   d. 30 Apr 1426  Mor  Alexandra of Lithuania,   f. ca 1365,   d. 19 Jun 1434  
0 @N6000000002322320449@ NOTE A soldier who drove back the Ottoman Turks, he briefly restored the kingdom
1 CONT of Poland-Lithuania to greatness for the last time. However, his endeavors to
1 CONT strengthen the position of the crown and to stabilize the army failed, and
1 CONT his own sons opposed him. His nobles showed little interest in defending
1 CONT their country, while John, though a brilliant general & organizer, was unable
1 CONT to prevent rebellion in his family and dissension among his subjects that
1 CONT finally led to Poland's downfall in the 18th century.
