0 @N6000000007329593223@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Sobieski's wife was French.  He was the last great King of Poland and after
1 CONT his death the country fell increasingly under Russian influence.
0 @N6000000002322320554@ NOTE He made Lithuania one ot the largest European states of his day. From 1341-45
1 CONT he was the prince of Krevo and Vitebsk and a vassal to his younger brother,
1 CONT Grand Duke Jauntis, whom he removed in collusion with another brother,
1 CONT Kestutis, with whose consent he became Grand duke of Lithuania. Defence of
1 CONT Lithuanian Ponemune and Podvine against the knights and their allies,
1 CONT invasion of the Russian and Ukranian lands subject to the Horde, and the
1 CONT desire to achieve Lithuanian hegemony were his foreign policy goals.
0 @N6000000002176664520@ NOTE He made Lithuania one ot the largest European states of his day. From 1341-45
1 CONT he was the prince of Krevo and Vitebsk and a vassal to his younger brother,
1 CONT Grand Duke Jauntis, whom he removed in collusion with another brother,
1 CONT Kestutis, with whose consent he became Grand duke of Lithuania. Defence of
1 CONT Lithuanian Ponemune and Podvine against the knights and their allies,
